  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IER Adaption of Agriculture to Climate Change phse II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development for climate change adaptation within the agriculture sector.
  Improved food self-sufficiency and living conditions of the population of the central and norther regions of Mali. Improved productivity of rain fed crops, dromedary produce, a sustainable flood recession farming system developed, natural resources management at river banks, improved nutrition for families and female agriculture production and income increased.</narrative>
  </description>
